          Severity: MODERATE                                                                                  
          Affected versions of @babel/helpers, @babel/runtime, @babel/runtime-corejs2, and @babel/runtime-    
          corejs3 are vulnerable to Inefficient Regular Expression Complexity. Babel generates a polyfill (the
          `wrapRegExp` helper) for `String.prototype.replace` on regular expressions with named capturing     
          groups that has quadratic (ReDoS) complexity when an untrusted replacement string containing the    
